target:    tests/PHPSTAN-BASELINE-CEILING
gate:      composer test:phpstan-baseline-ratchet
kind:      constant-weakening
expect:    tests/PHPSTAN-BASELINE-CEILING says 170 / 315
rationale: Raises the committed ceiling without the baseline changing. The exact-match half of the ratchet catches it; the descent half (against HEAD) is what stops the bump being made legitimately in the same commit as a regenerated, larger baseline.
---
--- a/tests/PHPSTAN-BASELINE-CEILING
+++ b/tests/PHPSTAN-BASELINE-CEILING
@@ -1 +1 @@
-162 315
+170 315
